			// Args 0-6, 8-10 confirmed float-encoded (the "+4 in low byte" quantization pattern
			// seen consistently — e.g. arg0 is ~50.0 in every single call across the whole game).
			// Arg 5 specifically is the launch/bounce power, live-confirmed 3 separate times
			// (Iron Spring Crate, Earth Worm, every "_LANDED_ON" crate) — see
			// project_crashengine_gamesettings memory. Arg 6 is a secondary component, only
			// nonzero in a few calls (e.g. Iron Spring's extra-high bounce branch). Args 7/11
			// left as "hex" on purpose — they look like small tagged flags (0xCDCDCDxx /
			// 0x000000FF pattern), not floats.
			"Name": "ApplyVelocity",
